	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d05_man1_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ざんねんですが　この　ポケモンは
めざめるパワーを　おぼえられない！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T03:24:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T03:24:37" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>残念ですが　この　ポケモンは
めざめるパワーを　覚えられない！</Text>
