	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d05_workman1a_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そこの　ほらあなは
こだいのぬけみち！▼
さいきん　みつかったんだが
なんと　なんと！▼
……あれ？　どこに
つながって　いたんだっけ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-22T02:09:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T06:34:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そこの　洞穴は
古代の抜け道！▼
最近　みつかったんだが
なんと　なんと！▼
……あれ？　どこに
つながって　いたんだっけ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-22T02:09:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T06:35:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX＝219、GRIDZ＝431</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T06:33:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T06:34:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T13:57:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d05_backpackerw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うみを　わたってこそ　ふね！
